---
// Themed (light/dark aware) diagram showing what actually happens when a
// product calls an AI model's API: the system prompt (set by the builder,
// hidden from the user) is combined with the user's message before it ever
// reaches the model, and the model's answer is shaped by both.
---

<div class="ard">
  <div class="ard__row">
    <div class="ard__box ard__box--hidden">
      <p class="ard__box-label">Set by the builder · hidden from the user</p>
      <strong>System prompt</strong>
      <span>"You are a support assistant for Acme. Only answer product questions. Be concise."</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ard__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</div>
    <div class="ard__box ard__box--user">
      <p class="ard__box-label">Typed by the user</p>
      <strong>User message</strong>
      <span>"Do you ship to Canada?"</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ard__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓ sent together, in one request, over the API</div>

  <div class="ard__box ard__box--model">
    <strong>The model</strong>
    <span>Answers using both — the user only ever sees their own message</span>
  </div>

  <div class="ard__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>

  <div class="ard__box ard__box--response">
    <strong>Response</strong>
    <span>Shaped by the hidden system prompt, even though it looks like a plain reply</span>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .ard {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    margin: 1.6em 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .ard__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ard__box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 2px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 16px 18px;
    text-align: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ard__box-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }

  .ard__box strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .ard__box span {
    display: block;
    color: var(--sub);
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ard__box--hidden {
    border-color: var(--blue);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 8%, var(--card));
  }

  .ard__box--user {
    background: var(--card);
  }

  .ard__box--model {
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .ard__box--response {
    max-width: 420px;
    border-style: dashed;
  }

  .ard__plus {
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--mute);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .ard__arrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--mute);
    margin: 6px 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .ard__row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
